<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85633" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πομποστολέω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέλλω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>conduct a
				procession,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				2.1325
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				1358
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>lead</i> or <i>carry in procession,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πομποστολεῖται τὰ ἱερά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					14.2.23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὸ σκάφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Am.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> metaph.,
				<i>make a pompous display of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μηδεμιᾶς ἄξια σπουδῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.70
				</span></i>
			.</div>
